      "id": 495576,
      "username": "TalhaButt2508",
      "name": "Talha Butt2508",
      "created_at": "2026-03-07T07:57:29.321Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>Yes I do understand that COGs is not created for <em><strong>is stock item = No</strong></em> Items and Profit and Loss Statement doesn’t consider it but apart from P&amp;L Statement Gross Profit Report is also of much concern.</p>\n<p>The Standard Script Report - Gross Profit, fetches the last buying rate as valuation rate of sales invoice’s service Item. Hence creating the discrepancy in the Report.</p>",
