    {
      "id": 495581,
      "username": "ahsantareen",
      "name": "Ahsan Tareen",
      "created_at": "2026-03-07T09:57:07.950Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/talhabutt2508\">@TalhaButt2508</a></p>\n<p><strong>Valuation Rate</strong> is contributing as COGS in Gross Profit Report and Last Purchase Rate is not Valuation Rate.</p>\n<p>Services Item’s Last Purchase Rate does not contribute anything in <strong>valuation process</strong> resulting <strong>NO</strong> COGS and that is why Gross Profit Report does not report COGS against services items sold.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e47774/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
