    {
      "id": 495671,
      "username": "TalhaButt2508",
      "name": "Talha Butt2508",
      "created_at": "2026-03-09T10:56:09.440Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Are you suggesting that <strong>valuation and COGS are two separate things?</strong></p>\n<p>The <strong>valuation being fetched for Service Items in the Gross Profit report appears to be incorrect.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>COGS is calculated as:</strong><br>\n<strong>Valuation Rate × Quantity Sold</strong></p>\n<p>If the <strong>Valuation Rate is being used in the Gross Profit report</strong>, it effectively represents the <strong>Cost of Goods Sold (COGS).</strong></p>\n<p>For your information, <strong>Service Items do not have Stock Ledger Entries (SLE)</strong>, so the <strong>Valuation Rate for them is derived from the Last Purchase Rate.</strong></p>\n<p>If this understanding is incorrect, could you please clarify the following?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/e/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/e/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945_2_690x161.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4juJzvWLeN68ri0UXeOZiNDDEPP\" width=\"690\" height=\"161\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/e/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945_2_690x161.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/e/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945_2_1035x241.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/e/1e3cde6da3f0129f624cbc48be4244b114b5c945_2_1380x322.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1629×381 38.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
